stellar_core.config.features.enableCustomGameTitle=Enable Custom Game Title
stellar_core.config.features.enableCustomGameTitle.tooltip=(Client) Allows you to modify the title of the game, highest priority, supports earlier versions such as CleanroomLoader 3029 (May do the same thing with other mods).
